# A page's learning state (README, "Learning, and knowing when it went stale"). Render with `just diagrams`.
direction: right

start: "" {shape: circle; width: 16; height: 16}
unread: Unread
read: Read
learned: Learned
stale: Stale

start -> unread
unread -> read: Mark read
read -> learned: pass every check
learned -> stale: an update rewrites the page
stale -> learned: pass the new or changed checks
